tools.description:
List all configured site profiles (name, siteUrl, platform) with an is_active flag indicating which one is currently active. Use this to discover available profile names before calling apimapper_use_profile to switch the active profile. Read-only — does not contact any site.

Response shape:
  { profile_count, active_profile, profiles: [{ name, siteUrl, platform, is_active, lastVerifiedAt? }] }
